      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>While moogle legends describe Moggle Mog as a kind, benevolent presence, the primal summoned by Mooglesguard is driven by the need to feast on ever-greater amounts of aether along with a large following to further solidify his being. - Moggle Mog</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 27, touch 19, flat-footed 18 (+1 size, +7 dex, +1 dodge, +4 armor, +4 natural)</p><p>HP 110 [169] (13d10+39)</p><p>Fort +7, Ref +15, Will +13</p><p>Weakness Shadow</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 20 ft., fly 30 ft. (good)</p><p>Ranged Harp (double charged non-elemental rod) +21/+16 (2d4+9/x2 non-elemental damage)</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>STR 12, DEX 24, CON 16, INT 8, WIS 20, CHA 28</p><p>Base Atk +13; CMB +13; CMD +30</p><p>Feats Dodge, Improved Power Weapons Wielder, Improved Sidestep, Just out of Reach, Low Profile, Mobility, Sidestep</p><p>Skills Fly +27</p><p>SQ Outsider traits, Does not Breathe, Does not Eat, Does not Sleep</p>"
